[1m━━ Step 2 of 4 · the foreman[0m
[38;2;138;143;152m  The foreman plans the work and decides what happens when a task needs[0m
[38;2;138;143;152m  judgment. It runs whenever work finishes, so it uses that agent's quota.[0m
[38;2;138;143;152m  Only claude and codex can be the foreman; it uses the model picked above[0m
[38;2;138;143;152m  and its effort.[0m
